            <p class="article-subheadline">
            <p class="article-byline">
            <div class="article-content">
                <section class="hero">
<h1>BECOME A FALCON</h1>

<h2>Take the First Step Toward Competing in College Athletics</h2>
<meta content="text/html; charset=us-ascii" http-equiv="Content-Type">
<style type="text/css">a {
    text-decoration: none;
    color: #464feb;
}
tr th, tr td {
    border: 1px solid #e6e6e6;
}
tr th {
    background-color: #f5f5f5;
}
</style>
<p>Are you interested in competing at the NCAA Division II level and taking the next step in your academic and athletic journey? Lackawanna College is proud to be transitioning to NCAA Division II and competing in the Pennsylvania State Athletic Conference (PSAC)—one of the most competitive conferences in the region.</p>

<p>Our student-athletes are provided with the resources, support, and opportunities to succeed in the classroom, in competition, and in life beyond athletics.  Prospective student-athletes can use this page to learn more about Lackawanna College Athletics, submit the Prospective Student-Athlete Form, and explore the facilities where our teams train and compete.<br>
<br>
<strong>Why Choose Lackawanna College Athletics?</strong></p>
</section>

<section>
<ul>
	<li><img alt="Checkmark" height="16" src="/images/2026/6/3/download__1_.jpg" style="display: inline-block;" width="16"> Compete at the <strong>NCAA Division II level</strong></li>
	<li><img alt="Checkmark" height="16" src="/images/2026/6/3/download__1_.jpg" style="display: inline-block;" width="16"> Member of the highly competitive <strong>PSAC</strong></li>
	<li><img alt="Checkmark" height="16" src="/images/2026/6/3/download__1_.jpg" style="display: inline-block;" width="16"> Strong focus on <strong>student-athlete development and academic success</strong></li>
	<li><img alt="Checkmark" height="16" src="/images/2026/6/3/download__1_.jpg" style="display: inline-block;" width="16"> Access to <strong>scholarship opportunities</strong></li>
	<li><img alt="Checkmark" height="16" src="/images/2026/6/3/download__1_.jpg" style="display: inline-block;" width="16"> Commitment to a <strong>holistic student-athlete experience</strong></li>
</ul>
<strong><img alt="Clipboard emoji" height="31" src="/images/2026/6/3/download__6_.png" style="display: inline-block;" width="31">  Get Started With Lackawanna College Athletics</strong>

<ul>
	<li><strong>Complete a Recruiting Questionnaire</strong> (by sport)</li>
	<li><strong>Apply to Lackawanna College</strong></li>
	<li>Submission does not create an obligation.</li>
</ul>
<strong>What to Expect?</strong><br>
<meta content="text/html; charset=us-ascii" http-equiv="Content-Type">
<style type="text/css">a {
    text-decoration: none;
    color: #464feb;
}
tr th, tr td {
    border: 1px solid #e6e6e6;
}
tr th {
    background-color: #f5f5f5;
}
</style>
<p>As a Lackawanna student-athlete, you will:</p>

<ul>
	<li>Compete against top regional and national programs</li>
	<li>Train in a structured, high-performance environment</li>
	<li>Receive support in academics, wellness, and career development</li>
	<li>Be part of a program committed to success on and off the field</li>
</ul>
</section>

<section id="sports">
<h3><img alt="Pointing Right Emoji" height="28" src="/images/2026/6/3/download__5_.png" style="display: inline-block;" width="28"> Select Your Sport</h3>

<table align="left" border="0" cellpadding="3" cellspacing="3" style="width:600px;">
	<tbody>
		<tr>
			<td style="text-align: center;"><a href="https://questionnaires.armssoftware.com/6fedbc84e7e8"><strong>BASEBALL</strong></a></td>
			<td style="text-align: center;"><a href="https://questionnaires.armssoftware.com/b9e28b77d865"><strong>MEN'S BASKETBALL</strong></a></td>
			<td style="text-align: center; white-space: nowrap;"><a href="https://questionnaires.armssoftware.com/8d7c71d4c299"><strong>WOMEN'S BASKETBALL</strong></a></td>
			<td style="text-align: center;"><a href="https://questionnaires.armssoftware.com/8bafc9d5140b"><strong>ESPORTS</strong></a></td>
		</tr>
		<tr>
			<td style="text-align: center; white-space: nowrap;"><strong><a href="https://questionnaires.armssoftware.com/5ad899886cbe">MEN'S CROSS COUNTRY</a></strong></td>
			<td style="text-align: center; white-space: nowrap;"><strong><a href="https://questionnaires.armssoftware.com/e108ae6a08c2">WOMEN'S CROSS COUNTRY</a></strong></td>
			<td style="text-align: center;"><strong><a href="https://questionnaires.armssoftware.com/41d0028544e6">MEN'S GOLF</a></strong></td>
			<td style="text-align: center;"><strong><a href="https://questionnaires.armssoftware.com/54424abca33c">WOMEN'S GOLF</a></strong></td>
		</tr>
		<tr>
			<td style="text-align: center;"><a href="https://questionnaires.armssoftware.com/a40690d1ad45"><strong>FOOTBALL</strong></a></td>
			<td style="text-align: center;"></td>
			<td style="text-align: center;"><a href="https://questionnaires.armssoftware.com/00f74bbb3f70"><strong>MEN'S SOCCER</strong></a></td>
			<td style="text-align: center; white-space: nowrap;"><a href="https://questionnaires.armssoftware.com/485b355500bf"><strong>WOMEN'S SOCCER</strong></a></td>
		</tr>
		<tr>
			<td style="text-align: center;"><a href="https://questionnaires.armssoftware.com/a5ccfbb60083"><strong>SOFTBALL</strong></a></td>
			<td style="text-align: center;"><a href="https://questionnaires.armssoftware.com/fcd778f03b0c"><strong>WOMEN'S VOLLEYBALL</strong></a></td>
			<td style="text-align: center;"><a href="https://questionnaires.armssoftware.com/232270844609"><strong>MEN'S WRESTLING</strong></a></td>
			<td style="text-align: center; white-space: nowrap;"><a href="https://questionnaires.armssoftware.com/7f3408c33ede"><strong>WOMEN'S WRESTLING</strong></a></td>
		</tr>
	</tbody>
</table>
 

<div class="sport-grid"><meta content="text/html; charset=us-ascii" http-equiv="Content-Type">
<style type="text/css">a {
    text-decoration: none;
    color: #464feb;
}
tr th, tr td {
    border: 1px solid #e6e6e6;
}
tr th {
    background-color: #f5f5f5;
}
</style>
<br>
<br>
<br>
<br>
<br>
<br>
<br>
<strong>Still have questions?</strong><br>
Reach out to our coaching staffs by visiting individual team pages.<br>
<br>
<meta content="text/html; charset=us-ascii" http-equiv="Content-Type">
<style type="text/css">a {
    text-decoration: none;
    color: #464feb;
}
tr th, tr td {
    border: 1px solid #e6e6e6;
}
tr th {
    background-color: #f5f5f5;
}
</style>
<h2>#TakeFlight</h2>

<p>Your future starts here. Join us as we enter a new era of Lackawanna Athletics at the NCAA Division II level.</p>
</div>
</section>
<style type="text/css">a {
